\noindent Let $\mu$ and $\nu$ be two probability measures supported inside $[0,1]^d$ obeying the finite energy and spectral gap conditions; in other words, we assume conditions \eqref{finite-energy} and \eqref{spectral-gap} hold for both $\mu$ and $\nu$ with the same parameters $a, b, \delta$ and $C_0$. Additionally, suppose that 
