\[ 2^M \leq \frac{16 \sqrt{d}}{\mathtt e}\leq \frac{C_d \delta}{a} \leq \frac{C_d}{a} \leq C_d \rho^{-c_0} \leq C_d 2^{c_0dT} \ll 2^{T},  \] 
